WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.973
Eddie the computer never sleeps.

2
00:00:02.673 --> 00:00:03.419
Not once.

3
00:00:04.119 --> 00:00:05.964
Just in case Maya taps her game.

4
00:00:07.064 --> 00:00:07.961
Theo giggles.

5
00:00:08.661 --> 00:00:12.290
Eddie is awake all day and all night, and nobody is even playing!

6
00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:13.424
Hmm.

7
00:00:14.124 --> 00:00:15.394
That is a lot of waiting.

8
00:00:16.494 --> 00:00:16.837
Look!

9
00:00:17.537 --> 00:00:19.452
Here is Lulu, a tiny spark.

10
00:00:20.152 --> 00:00:22.360
Lulu naps... until someone taps.

11
00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:24.266
Maya taps.

12
00:00:24.966 --> 00:00:25.319
Pop!

13
00:00:25.719 --> 00:00:29.066
Lulu wakes up, runs the game, and goes right back to sleep.

14
00:00:29.766 --> 00:00:31.258
One tap, one job.

15
00:00:32.358 --> 00:00:35.029
Now you know: Lulu only works when you need her.

16
00:00:35.729 --> 00:00:37.372
That is AWS Lambda.

17
00:00:38.472 --> 00:00:39.601
Want more Cloud Town?

18
00:00:40.301 --> 00:00:42.267
Maya has the whole story in her book.

19
00:00:42.967 --> 00:00:44.559
Find it with the link in the bio.

20
00:00:45.259 --> 00:00:46.267
See you next time!
